  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoring Agricultural Production and Livestock Protection for Flood Affected Households in Gaza Pro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the intervention is to address the short-term needs of flood-affected smallholder households in the districts of Chibuto and Guija in Gaza Province, to restore household agricultural production, improve access to staples and contribute to improved food security and nutrition outcomes</narrative>
